        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[The 23-Year-Old Flaw at the Heart of CPAN: An RCE in the Perl Infrastructure]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[The report: <a href="https://github.com/andk/pause/security/advisories/GHSA-p262-w3xr-phm4">Arbitrary code execution by uploading a crafted distribution tarball</a>. Wow. Still using open with 2-parameters? This is why I recommended everyone to run Perl::Critic with various rules on their code-base and to modernize their code-base. There is always a push-back.]]></description>
